<title>UK: LIFFE coffee ends higher, cocoa down, sugar mixed.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee ends higher, cocoa down, sugar mixed.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Coffee ends higher, with switches inflating volume. Sept up $19 at $1,840.</p>
<p>COCOA - Ends lower after NY fall. Sept 50 stg lower at 1,108 stg.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Nearbys lower on EU tender, weaker NY, but distant months move up. Aug down $1.90 at $320.00 at 1611 GMT</p>
</text>
